Models are the main component of langchain. Where we basically send the prompt
and generate something out of it. Model usally have the size of 100 gb that's why
we generally use the API of the model s example anthropic, openAI, gemini


There are two types of model:-

1. Language model - we used to send some text and model used to return in text form.

2. Embedding model - It's basically get the text and split and embed the text into vector and store in vector DB.

